README

To generate a grid of subfigures of the students do this:

* Download the Siena Class Roster to this directory. This produces a file 
    Class_list.html

and a directory.
    Class_list_files

* Run the parser.
    python siena_class_roster.py Class_list.html > temp.tex

* Build the pdf.
    pdflatex temp.tex

* View your class list!
    evince temp.pdf -f
